// Offspring [CR#702.175a]: "Offspring [cost]" means "You may pay an additional
// [cost] as you cast this spell. When this permanent enters, if its offspring
// cost was paid, create a 1/1 token copy of it." Two abilities — Kicker's
// optional-additional-cost static ([CR#702.33a]) plus Undying's shape of
// intervening-if ETB triggered ability ([CR#603.4]) — over the copy grammar's
// `Create(1, Copy(...))`.
//
// Pieces (all over existing primitives — no engine gap):
//   - the optional cost: `Static(CostOption(components: Param(0), tag: Offspring))`
//     — Kicker's tagged `OptionalCost` ([CR#118.8b], announced at [CR#601.2b]).
//     `CostTag` is an open namespace, so `Offspring` is a valid tag with no
//     engine change; `PaidCost(Offspring)` is its paid-read channel.
//   - the ETB trigger: `Triggered(event: ThisEnters, condition: PaidCost(Offspring),
//     effect: ...)` — "when this permanent enters, if its offspring cost was
//     paid" ([CR#603.4] intervening-if reading the [CR#702.33d]-style tag).
//   - the effect: `Create(1, Copy(source: SelfCard, ...))` — a token copy of
//     the entering permanent ([CR#707.1]) EXCEPT it's 1/1 (`Power(Set(1))` +
//     `Toughness(Set(1))`, [CR#707.9d]).
(
    name: "Offspring",
    template: "offspring ${0}",
    kinds: [KeywordAbility],
    params: [Cost],
    body: Composite(
        name: "Offspring",
        abilities: [
            Static(CostOption(components: Param(0), tag: Offspring)),
            Triggered(
                event: ThisEnters,
                condition: PaidCost(Offspring),
                effect: Create(1, Copy(source: SelfCard, exceptions: [
                    Modify(Power(Set(1))),
                    Modify(Toughness(Set(1))),
                ])),
            ),
        ],
    ),
)
